  "entries": [
    "You maintain a brisk performance that keeps allies on the move. You and your allies in the area can Hustle for the spell's duration, in addition to your other exploration activities (your exploration activity is Sustain|Sustaining this Spell). You and your allies then become temporarily immune for 1 day.",
